{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":708048,\"title\":\"Isolation\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"In a shelter, two men face isolation and paranoia, while the whole outside world and society seem to have disappeared.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qb9Zy0UOE9hd7a9gOTuXJ9fk9Vj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kPcs8CLpi2SbX2sQs6INgvnxXIC.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2015,\"runtime\":6,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IT\",\"name\":\"Italy\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Stefano Bolognini\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2502912,\"name\":\"Stefano Bolognini\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2651728,\"name\":\"Andrea Lo Mastro\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2502917,\"name\":\"Massimiliano Saltori\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n4hGhnePxa8G5sdqMCBEcAhrhRj.jpg\"},{\"id\":2502917,\"name\":\"Massimiliano Saltori\",\"character\":\"Civilian\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n4hGhnePxa8G5sdqMCBEcAhrhRj.jpg\"},{\"id\":2502912,\"name\":\"Stefano Bolognini\",\"character\":\"Soldier\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1101383,\"title\":\"The End of Oak Street\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7DmtuAK5gYGlMFA45Oxkl1bEpIC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w9AiymbmQGt3jdtsm78HdfKkChy.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a mysterious cosmic event rips Oak Street from suburbia and transports their neighborhood to someplace unknown, the Platt family soon discovers that their very survival depends on them sticking together as they navigate their now unrecognizable surroundings.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":198663,\"title\":\"The Maze Runner\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ode14q7WtDugFDp78fo9lCsmay9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eTlcNXGv32zkVI7ZDHhfeaKHXKQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A teenager with no memory of his past finds himself among a group of boys living in a walled enclosure surrounded by a massive, ever-changing maze. As he struggles to adapt to their rules and society, he begins to uncover clues that may lead to escape and the truth behind their confinement.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1236153,\"title\":\"Mercy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pyok1kZJCfyuFapYXzHcy7BLlQa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gIClklFGYBe0uiOoiP2vtocJbss.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the near future, a detective stands on trial accused of murdering his wife. He has ninety minutes to prove his innocence to the advanced AI Judge he once championed, before it determines his fate.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":51876,\"title\":\"Limitless\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r8anWUCVK7MZEolcfPrM9eFkRO4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9V6Yq2ZVUmyAPcPyDcCBPnkluKF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The life of an unsuccessful writer is transformed by a top-secret 'smart drug' that allows him to use 100% of his brain and become a perfect version of himself. His enhanced abilities soon attract shadowy forces that threaten his new life.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":45612,\"title\":\"Source Code\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nTr0lvAzeQmUjgSgDEHTJpnrxTz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mDb4uku4zEElsITXDpbir4fR0HW.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When decorated soldier Captain Colter Stevens wakes up in the body of an unknown man, he discovers he's part of a mission to find the bomber of a Chicago commuter train.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":406990,\"title\":\"What Happened to Monday\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/atOgZMJpMrTdpqvPiHVPfBhR61l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j7ij93mtHXAF8D3PjRSEaKPHpIE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a world where families are limited to one child due to overpopulation, a set of identical septuplets must avoid being put to a long sleep by the government and dangerous infighting while investigating the disappearance of one of their own.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":619730,\"title\":\"Don't Worry Darling\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wjAJWfuE5OQm5zerlOAbTxdHFMV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tfCNMP37jRX3TOetuce7FLkxNKa.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Alice and Jack are lucky to be living in the idealized community of Victory, the experimental company town housing the men who work for the top-secret Victory Project and their families. But when cracks in their idyllic life begin to appear, exposing flashes of something much more sinister lurking beneath the attractive façade, Alice can’t help questioning exactly what they’re doing in Victory, and why.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":615173,\"title\":\"The Witch: Part 2. The Other One\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9YTuscJXmr9Iua62amCgGSU8PDW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iryef4LKiPQkvhNJS1EtLlay3br.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A girl wakes up in a huge secret laboratory, then accidentally meets another girl who is trying to protect her house from a gang. The mystery girl overthrows the gang with her unexpected powers, and laboratory staff set out to find her.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4858,\"title\":\"The Invasion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oS5rMuJXwNZZPx0ojhvjgduglD2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nPpIFyRRe33xKUj3nEHZZbz364x.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Washington, D.C. psychologist Carol Bennell and her colleague Dr. Ben Driscoll are the only two people on Earth who are aware of an epidemic running rampant through the city. They discover an alien virus aboard a crashed space shuttle that transforms anyone who comes into contact with it into unfeeling drones while they sleep. Carol realizes her son holds the key to stopping the spread of the plague and she races to find him before it is too late.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":37686,\"title\":\"Super 8\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pUWIjaMMYJjeBm5bJyE3mIXdQ62.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x6Dr9i6vhWICxs7hnX2BakcMtPd.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In late 1970s Ohio, a group of friends filming a homemade zombie movie witness a devastating train derailment. Soon after, their quiet town is gripped by unexplained disappearances, strange phenomena, and a growing sense of fear, as they uncover that something terrifying has been set loose.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22824,\"title\":\"The Fourth Kind\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vfnsGUwurUQqlpvArBvUVc9rYXa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4Ue8De8AXVrSWvFQMzmoJQn4Pxe.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Since the 1960s, a disproportionate number of the population in and around Nome, Alaska, have gone missing. Despite FBI investigations, the disappearances remain a mystery. Dr. Abigail Tyler, a psychologist, may be on the verge of blowing the unsolved cases wide open when, during the course of treating her patients, she finds evidence of alien abductions.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8836,\"title\":\"The X-Files: I Want to Believe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3zQMhutUMJP6lK49x7i2YfsOHL9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fCdc3TZNNHGk1ZQBXENdWLqjUio.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mulder and Scully are called back to duty by the FBI when a former priest claims to be receiving psychic visions pertaining to a kidnapped agent.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"77W6dg7jO_Q\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"PqUms2EMp24\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"q6ww9TZPPRg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}